(Manufacturing Equipment Copilot: Backend and Agent Guide) Tj T*
T*
(This document explains the project for a beginner. It describes what happens from the moment a user) Tj T*
(types a question until the answer appears, why each backend file exists, how BigQuery retrieval works,) Tj T*
(and how documents become searchable.) Tj T*
T*
(1. What the application does) Tj T*
T*
(The application is a multimodal retrieval-augmented generation \(RAG\) assistant for manufacturing) Tj T*
(manuals. It can answer questions using indexed PDF manuals, return grounded text and tables, show manual) Tj T*
(images with descriptions, and include relevant manual video or QR links.) Tj T*
T*
(The system has four major parts:) Tj T*
T*
(1. Frontend: the React interface where the user starts a chat, uploads an image, and reads the response.) Tj T*
(2. FastAPI backend: validates requests, manages sessions, runs retrieval, calls the agent, and returns) Tj T*
(JSON.) Tj T*
(3. BigQuery and Cloud Storage: BigQuery stores searchable chunks and related document metadata; Cloud) Tj T*
(Storage stores processed manual assets.) Tj T*
(4. Google models and Document AI: Gemini creates query/document embeddings and generates the final) Tj T*
(grounded response; Document AI is used offline to inspect QR codes during ingestion.) Tj T*
T*
(2. Repository structure) Tj T*
T*
(text) Tj T*
(Multimodel-RAG-for-Manufacturing-Industry/) Tj T*
(??? backend/) Tj T*
(?   ??? app/) Tj T*
(?   ?   ??? main.py                 FastAPI application and router setup) Tj T*
(?   ?   ??? config.py               Environment configuration and validation) Tj T*
(?   ?   ??? api/                    HTTP endpoints) Tj T*
(?   ?   ??? agent/                  Planning, Gemini agent, orchestration) Tj T*
(?   ?   ??? retrieval/              Embeddings and BigQuery retrieval) Tj T*
(?   ?   ??? media/                  Images, PDFs, videos, and asset loading) Tj T*
(?   ?   ??? responses/               Response schemas and response assembly) Tj T*
(?   ?   ??? sessions/                In-memory chat sessions) Tj T*
(?   ??? scripts/                    Offline QR and connection utilities) Tj T*
(?   ??? tests/                      Offline backend tests) Tj T*
(?   ??? .env                        Local secrets and settings \(never commit\)) Tj T*
(?   ??? .env.example                Safe configuration template) Tj T*
(?   ??? requirements.txt             Backend dependencies) Tj T*
(?   ??? run.cmd                     Backend launcher) Tj T*
(??? frontend/                       React/Vite application) Tj T*
(??? src/simple_ingestion/            PDF processing and BigQuery loading) Tj T*
(??? data/                            Local raw/processed data when used) Tj T*
(??? terraform/                      Infrastructure definitions) Tj T*
T*
T*
(3. Starting the application) Tj T*
ET
endstream
