T*
(backend/app/api/health_routes.py) Tj T*
T*
(GET /health confirms that FastAPI is running and reports the session implementation. It is a process) Tj T*
(check, not a full BigQuery/Gemini connectivity test.) Tj T*
T*
(7. Agent and orchestration files) Tj T*
T*
(backend/app/agent/planner.py) Tj T*
T*
(The planner makes a small preliminary Gemini call and returns a QueryPlan. It identifies the search) Tj T*
(query, main topic, follow-up state, whether images/videos/sources are wanted, and whether clarification) Tj T*
(is needed. It does not answer the technical question.) Tj T*
T*
(backend/app/agent/instructions.py) Tj T*
T*
(Contains the system rules given to the final agent. The rules require answers to use approved manual) Tj T*
(evidence, prohibit invented procedures, require evidence IDs for technical blocks, and require image) Tj T*
(descriptions when images are shown.) Tj T*
T*
(backend/app/agent/agent.py) Tj T*
T*
(Defines the Google ADK root agent and its model settings. It receives a JSON payload containing the) Tj T*
(question, workflow state, approved evidence, images, links, and warnings. It returns structured JSON) Tj T*
(rather than free-form text.) Tj T*
T*
(backend/app/agent/chat_service.py) Tj T*
T*
(This is the orchestration layer. It connects planning, retrieval, media preparation, ADK execution,) Tj T*
(validation, and session state.) Tj T*
T*
(For inventory questions such as ?which machine documents do you have??, it uses) Tj T*
(list_available_documents\(\) directly so every distinct machine/document pair is returned. It does not use) Tj T*
(similarity ranking for that request.) Tj T*
ET
