T*
(12. Ingestion flow) Tj T*
T*
(The ingestion code under src/simple_ingestion runs before chat retrieval:) Tj T*
T*
(1. pdf_extractor.py extracts PDF text and page elements.) Tj T*
(2. table_extractor.py extracts table content.) Tj T*
(3. chunk_builder.py creates text, image, table, and link chunks with machine/document/page metadata.) Tj T*
(4. relationship_builder.py records relationships between page elements.) Tj T*
(5. embedding_generator.py creates RETRIEVAL_DOCUMENT embeddings using 768 dimensions.) Tj T*
(6. gcs_ingestor.py uploads processed assets to Cloud Storage.) Tj T*
(7. bigquery_loader.py validates vectors and loads the normalized tables into BigQuery.) Tj T*
(8. The loader rejects a vector whose declared or actual dimension differs from the shared 768 dimension.) Tj T*
(9. pipeline.py coordinates these steps; main.py provides the ingestion CLI.) Tj T*
T*
(The machine name is metadata supplied during ingestion. It may be different for every manual, but every) Tj T*
(document must use the same embedding model and dimension for shared vector search.) Tj T*
T*
(13. Document AI and QR workflow) Tj T*
T*
(backend/scripts/extract_qr_links.py) Tj T*
T*
(Runs offline Document AI processing for a PDF page or image, extracts QR results, validates safe URLs,) Tj T*
(and writes a reviewable JSON result. It does not modify BigQuery.) Tj T*
T*
(backend/scripts/save_qr_links.py) Tj T*
T*
(Saves only manually verified QR results to the QR links table. Chat reads these saved links; chat does) Tj T*
(not call Document AI or write BigQuery data.) Tj T*
T*
(backend/scripts/check_connections.py) Tj T*
T*
(Performs a small connectivity check for configured Google services.) Tj T*
T*
(14. Error handling) Tj T*
T*
(- 400: invalid or empty request, unsupported image type, or oversized upload.) Tj T*
(- 404: missing session or asset.) Tj T*
(- 410: expired or deleted session.) Tj T*
(- 502: model returned invalid structured evidence.) Tj T*
(- 503: Google authentication, Gemini, BigQuery, or asset service failure.) Tj T*
(- 504: request exceeded the backend timeout.) Tj T*
T*
(If chat reports service-account impersonation denial, the signed-in Google account needs) Tj T*
(roles/iam.serviceAccountTokenCreator on the configured service account. This is an IAM issue, not a) Tj T*
(Uvicorn issue.) Tj T*
T*
(15. Useful checks) Tj T*
ET
endstream
