(- Ten offline backend tests covering API behavior, media completeness, evidence validation, and QR) Tj T*
(provenance.) Tj T*
T*
(The safest mental model is: BigQuery finds approved evidence, Gemini explains only that evidence, and) Tj T*
(the response builder decides what can be shown to the user.) Tj T*
T*
(17. Complete code reference) Tj T*
T*
(This section maps each important source file to its responsibility and execution point.) Tj T*
T*
(Backend application files) Tj T*
T*
(| File | Main code | Why it exists | When it runs |) Tj T*
(|---|---|---|---|) Tj T*
(| app/main.py | Creates FastAPI, CORS, lifespan, and routers | One application entry point | Backend) Tj T*
(startup |) Tj T*
(| app/config.py | Loads .env, validates project, dataset, bucket, model, dimensions, timeout | Keeps) Tj T*
(settings in one place and rejects unsafe configuration | Imported during startup |) Tj T*
(| app/api/chat_routes.py | chat\(\) endpoint and exception mapping | Receives questions and uploads and) Tj T*
(returns HTTP responses | Every chat request |) Tj T*
(| app/api/session_routes.py | Create, read, delete session endpoints | Gives the frontend a conversation) Tj T*
(ID | Opening, loading, or closing a chat |) Tj T*
(| app/api/image_routes.py | original_image\(\) | Serves approved image assets | Browser requests an image |) Tj T*
(| app/api/health_routes.py | health\(\) | Simple process health check | Browser or operator health check |) Tj T*
(| app/sessions/session_store.py | In-memory entries, locks, TTL, ADK session service | Stores history) Tj T*
(and guided troubleshooting state | Every session and chat request |) Tj T*
T*
(Agent files) Tj T*
T*
(| File | Main code | Why it exists | When it runs |) Tj T*
(|---|---|---|---|) Tj T*
(| app/agent/planner.py | understand\(\) and cached model client | Converts a user message into QueryPlan |) Tj T*
(Before normal retrieval |) Tj T*
(| app/agent/instructions.py | Grounding and answer rules | Prevents invented technical information |) Tj T*
(Sent to the final agent |) Tj T*
(| app/agent/agent.py | ADK root_agent and generation settings | Defines the final structured Gemini) Tj T*
(agent | After evidence is prepared |) Tj T*
(| app/agent/chat_service.py | answer_question\(\) | Orchestrates planning, retrieval, media, ADK,) Tj T*
(validation, and state | Every accepted chat message |) Tj T*
T*
(chat_service.py is the central control file. It first handles inventory questions directly, then calls) Tj T*
(the planner. It stops early for clarification, out-of-scope requests, or an incompatible model. For a) Tj T*
(normal question it calls retrieval, prepares assets, sends a compact evidence payload to ADK, validates) Tj T*
(the returned JSON, builds frontend blocks, and updates the session.) Tj T*
T*
(Retrieval files) Tj T*
T*
(| File | Main code | Why it exists | When it runs |) Tj T*
ET
