(|---|---|---|---|) Tj T*
(| app/retrieval/embeddings.py | embedding_client\(\), get_embedding\(\) | Creates the 768-number query) Tj T*
(vector | Normal semantic search |) Tj T*
(| app/retrieval/bigquery_client.py | bq_client\(\), query\(\) | Runs parameterized BigQuery safely | Every) Tj T*
(BigQuery operation |) Tj T*
(| app/retrieval/manual_search.py | search_manual\(\), list_available_documents\(\), check_tables\(\) | Finds) Tj T*
(approved chunks and page context | Normal questions and inventory questions |) Tj T*
(| app/retrieval/qr_link_search.py | QR link lookup functions | Reads verified QR destinations for) Tj T*
(selected pages | Link, video, or QR results |) Tj T*
T*
(manual_search.py is intentionally the retrieval boundary. The vector seed query reads document_chunks.) Tj T*
(Related tables are enrichment sources, not independent semantic retrieval sources.) Tj T*
T*
(Media files) Tj T*
T*
(| File | Main code | Why it exists | When it runs |) Tj T*
(|---|---|---|---|) Tj T*
(| app/media/prepare_media.py | prepare_media\(\) | Selects images and links and collects warnings | After) Tj T*
(chunks are retrieved |) Tj T*
(| app/media/manual_images.py | Storage client, image loading, PDF rendering, normalization | Loads) Tj T*
(original manual assets safely | When images or pages are needed |) Tj T*
(| app/media/video_links.py | URL validation and video discovery | Keeps only safe, relevant video links) Tj T*
(| When links or videos are requested |) Tj T*
T*
(The machine_name on each retrieved row is passed into asset loading. This is required because multiple) Tj T*
(machines can have documents with similar names.) Tj T*
T*
(Response files) Tj T*
