(21. One complete code flow) Tj T*
T*
(A normal text question) Tj T*
T*
(Example: What is the saw blade speed range for HAB-3232?) Tj T*
T*
(1. ChatInput.jsx collects the text.) Tj T*
(2. useChat.js calls chatService.sendChat\(\).) Tj T*
(3. chatService.js sends multipart form data to /chat.) Tj T*
(4. chat_routes.chat\(\) validates the session and text length.) Tj T*
(5. session_store.py loads the session and locks it so two requests cannot modify it at once.) Tj T*
(6. chat_service.answer_question\(\) calls planner.understand\(\).) Tj T*
(7. planner.py asks Gemini for a QueryPlan.) Tj T*
(8. embeddings.get_embedding\(\) creates the 768-value query vector.) Tj T*
(9. manual_search.search_manual\(\) runs the fixed parameterized query against document_chunks.) Tj T*
(10. BigQuery ranks rows by cosine distance plus keyword hits.) Tj T*
(11. Explicit machine names cause per-machine candidate retention, so one machine cannot crowd out) Tj T*
(another.) Tj T*
(12. manual_search.py expands selected chunks to their document pages and enriches approved context.) Tj T*
(13. prepare_media.py loads requested images, PDF pages, and links.) Tj T*
(14. chat_service.py converts long internal chunk IDs to short evidence IDs.) Tj T*
(15. agent.py sends the question and approved evidence to ADK.) Tj T*
(16. instructions.py tells Gemini to answer every distinct question and avoid unsupported claims.) Tj T*
(17. Gemini returns AgentAnswer JSON.) Tj T*
(18. schemas.py validates the JSON.) Tj T*
(19. chat_service.py maps short evidence IDs back to real chunk IDs.) Tj T*
(20. response_builder.py creates text/table/image/link blocks and adds descriptions.) Tj T*
(21. session_store.py records the user and assistant messages.) Tj T*
(22. chat_routes.py returns JSON.) Tj T*
(23. ChatThread.jsx, ChatMessage.jsx, and ResponseRenderer.jsx display the answer.) Tj T*
T*
(A machine-document inventory question) Tj T*
T*
(Example: Which machine documents do you have?) Tj T*
ET
endstream
