T*
(1. The frontend sends the normal /chat request.) Tj T*
(2. chat_service.py recognizes the inventory wording.) Tj T*
(3. list_available_documents\(\) runs a grouped query over document_chunks.) Tj T*
(4. Results are grouped by machine_name in Python.) Tj T*
(5. text_response\(\) creates a direct answer.) Tj T*
(6. The session records the response without calling the model or vector search.) Tj T*
T*
(A question asking for an image) Tj T*
T*
(1. Normal planning and document_chunks retrieval occur first.) Tj T*
(2. The planner sets wants_visual=true.) Tj T*
(3. manual_search.py keeps image candidates and geometry for selected pages.) Tj T*
(4. prepare_media.py calls read_image\(\) or render_page\(\) with the row's machine name.) Tj T*
(5. The image bytes are sent to the agent and later returned as an approved asset.) Tj T*
(6. ResponseRenderer.jsx displays the image, caption, and detailed description.) Tj T*
T*
(A question asking for video or QR links) Tj T*
T*
(1. Normal chunk retrieval identifies relevant document pages.) Tj T*
(2. document_links and the QR links table are restricted to those pages.) Tj T*
(3. video_links.py validates and resolves relevant video targets.) Tj T*
(4. response_builder.py keeps only links supported by the selected evidence.) Tj T*
(5. The frontend renders links or embedded video targets.) Tj T*
T*
(A two-machine comparison) Tj T*
T*
(1. The planner receives both machine names.) Tj T*
(2. manual_search.py extracts identifiers such as HAB-3232 and HSG-2550.) Tj T*
(3. BigQuery keeps up to 10 relevant seed chunks per mentioned machine.) Tj T*
(4. Same-page enrichment runs for the selected chunks.) Tj T*
(5. The final agent receives evidence from both machines and is instructed to answer every distinct part.) Tj T*
(6. If either manual lacks the requested specification, that part is reported as unavailable rather than) Tj T*
(invented.) Tj T*
T*
(22. Why a model error can occur after successful retrieval) Tj T*
T*
(BigQuery retrieval and Gemini answer generation are separate operations. A request can successfully) Tj T*
(retrieve chunks and still fail later when ADK calls Gemini. A 504 DEADLINE_EXCEEDED from the final model) Tj T*
(call means the model did not finish the structured response in time, often because the evidence payload) Tj T*
(contains too much text, image data, or metadata. The backend therefore bounds the evidence context and) Tj T*
(output size. A 503 shown by the frontend is the safe HTTP wrapper around that provider failure; the) Tj T*
(backend terminal contains the underlying Google error.) Tj T*
T*
(23. Full system architecture flow) Tj T*
T*
(A. Manual ingestion flow) Tj T*
T*
(text) Tj T*
ET
endstream
