(Expired session     -> 410 response from chat_routes.py) Tj T*
(Gemini busy         -> 503 response with retry message) Tj T*
(Gemini deadline     -> 503 response; backend terminal shows 504) Tj T*
(Invalid agent JSON  -> 502 response from evidence validation) Tj T*
(BigQuery failure    -> 503 response; backend terminal contains query error) Tj T*
(Asset unavailable   -> response continues with asset warning) Tj T*
