T*
(The code was modularized without changing the intended application behavior. Backend responsibilities) Tj T*
(were separated into API, agent, retrieval, media, responses, sessions, and scripts. Frontend components) Tj T*
(were separated into chat, layout, hooks, services, configuration, and utilities. BigQuery retrieval now) Tj T*
(supports multiple machine names, uses 768-dimensional embeddings, retains evidence per explicitly) Tj T*
(mentioned machine, provides a direct all-document inventory query, and passes machine metadata into) Tj T*
(media loading. The agent is instructed to answer every distinct question in a message. Context size is) Tj T*
(bounded to reduce Gemini deadline failures, while evidence validation keeps answers grounded.) Tj T*
ET
